                                "sense_id": "5631525a-14c9-3340-80ba-0a1285f9899f",
                                "text": "To shake off the maddening and wearying limitations of time and space and natural law—to be linked with the vast outside—to come close to the nighted and abysmal secrets of the infinite and the ultimate—surely such a thing was worth the risk of one’s life, soul, and sanity!"
                            }
